{"repositoryId":1150593251,"availability":"available","full":"adops-tool/App-Finder-100k","name":"App-Finder-100k","description":"🔍 Streamlit tool for discovering low-to-mid install Android apps on Google Play. Multi-locale search, SQLite deduplication, novelty scoring, parallel metadata fetch with caching. Built for market research workflows targeting 10k-100k install segments. Export clean CSV datasets in one click.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2026-02-05T13:14:17Z","updated":"2026-10-15T17:16:32Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://app-finder-100k.streamlit.app/","topics":["android","android-apps","app-analytics","app-discovery","app-finder","app-research","data-analysis","data-mining","discovery-tool","google-play","google-play-scraper","market-intelligence","market-research","mobile-apps","play-store","python","research-tool","sqlite","streamlit","web-scraping"],"demo":"https://app-finder-100k.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:12.950Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:12.950Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:49:12.950Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:49:12.950Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Discover low-to-mid install Android apps with signal, not noise.","[](#tech-stack) [](#tech-stack) [](LICENSE) []( [](#project-structure)","A production-minded Streamlit toolkit for hunting Google Play apps in specific install ranges, de-duplicating findings across sessions, and exporting clean research datasets in one click."],"features":["Randomized multi-query discovery over a weighted keyword pool (niche + games + utilities).","Multi-locale search strategy to surface apps from different language/country combinations.","Deduplication pipeline backed by persistent SQLite state (seenapps) so you don’t re-review the same app every run.","Detail caching layer (appdetailscache)